# Default apps per file type, applied with `duti <this file>`. Format: <bundle id> <type id> <role>
# duti only allows comments on their own line.
# Extensions without a registered type get a generated dyn.* id - find one with: mdls -raw -name kMDItemContentType <file>
# .ts is left out on purpose: macOS maps it to MPEG-2 video (public.mpeg-2-transport-stream)

